**7.3.17**: \(C({-}z){=}{-}C(z)\), \(S({-}z){=}{-}S(z)\) .
**7.3.18**: \(C(iz){=}iC(z)\), \(S(iz){=}-iS(z)\)__
**7.3.19**: \(C(\overline{z}){=}\overline{C(\overline{z})}\), \(S(\overline{z}){=}\overline{S(\overline{z})}\)__
**7.3.20**: \(C(x){\to}\frac{1}{2}\), \(S(x){\to}\frac{1}{2}\) (\(x{\to}\infty\))__
